{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-architecture","title":"睡眠结构","docCount":3,"url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"sleep-stages-and-cycles","title":"睡眠阶段与周期","url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/sleep-stages-and-cycles","wordCount":2082,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"nrem-deep-sleep-functions","title":"NREM 深度睡眠功能","url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/nrem-deep-sleep-functions","wordCount":2519,"readingTime":11},{"seq":3,"slug":"rem-sleep-and-dreaming","title":"REM 睡眠与梦境","url":"/h/health-medicine/sleep-science/sleep-architecture/rem-sleep-and-dreaming","wordCount":2681,"readingTime":11}],"introMarkdown":"# 睡眠结构\n\n本章探讨人类睡眠的内部架构——从宏观的睡眠周期到微观的脑电波特征。\n\n## 内容概要\n\n- **睡眠阶段与周期**：一个完整的睡眠夜晚由 4-6 个约 90-110 分钟的周期组成，每个周期包含 NREM 和 REM 两大阶段\n- **NREM 深度睡眠功能**：N3 慢波睡眠是身体修复、生长激素分泌和陈述性记忆巩固的关键窗口\n- **REM 睡眠与梦境**：快速眼动睡眠负责情绪调节、程序性学习和类淋巴系统清除代谢废物\n\n理解睡眠结构是后续学习昼夜节律、健康影响和优化策略的基础。\n"}